From 2222222222222222222222222222222222222222 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Mon, 8 Jun 2026 12:20:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] stm32mp257-dk: disable TAMP NVRAM driver

TAMP NVRAM is backed by the TAMP firewall resources. Disable this OP-TEE
consumer before migrating individual TAMP resources to non-secure Linux.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@local>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
@@ -336 +336 @@
-CFG_STM32_TAMP_NVRAM ?= y
+CFG_STM32_TAMP_NVRAM ?= n
-- 
2.39.5
